Package: scenecutbatch
Version: 0.1.0
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pip, ffmpeg
Maintainer: Scene Cut Batch <maintainer@scenecutbatch.com>
Description: Batch scene-cut detection with FCP7 XML virtual subclips
 SceneCutBatch detects hard scene cuts across folders of video clips using
 PySceneDetect and emits FCP7 XML files with virtual
 subclips referencing the original media (no duplication).
